            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">Tasks meant for a colleague stay theirs.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.14</h2>
<ul>
  <li>When someone @mentions a colleague in Slack, Jarvis no longer turns it into a task for you, even if the name looks like yours.</li>
  <li>Task details show the real name of the person a message mentions, instead of "@someone".</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
